work filepicker-ws
wait 2
type hello, world
key C-a M-d
wait 0.3
snap alt-d
key C-e
type  foo bar
key M-b M-b
type Y
wait 0.3
snap alt-b
key M-f
type Z
wait 0.3
snap alt-f
key C-u
type line1\
key Enter
type line2
key C-j
type line3
key PPage
type <
wait 0.3
snap pgup
key NPage
type >
wait 0.3
snap pgdn
key Escape
wait 0.1
key Escape
wait 0.6
type @
wait 1.2
key NPage
wait 0.3
snap at-pgdn
key C-k
wait 0.3
snap at-ck
